# This folder holds the site alongside a lot of large source media (Procreate
# files, video, raw exports) that must not go into git — two of them are over
# GitHub's 100MB per-file limit. So this is an allowlist: everything at the
# root is ignored, and only the site is added back.

/*

!/index.html
!/css/
!/assets/
!/tools/
!/README.md
!/.gitignore

# Figma masters. Re-exportable from Figma, and only needed locally to run
# tools/process-assets.py — the built assets/*.webp are committed, so the
# site builds and serves without them.
/assets/source/

.DS_Store
